{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261101/photo/bkn-20261101044614758-1101_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261101073130\"/><p>現場火光熊熊。</p><p>將軍澳發生縱火案。今日(11月1日)凌晨1時12分， 有途人報案，指停泊在寶寧路25號一公共單車泊位的數輛單車起火。消防員接報到場將火救熄。經初步調查，上址共有9輛單車被燒毀，消防相信起火原因有可疑。案件列作「縱火」，暫未有人被捕。事件中，沒有人受傷，毋須疏散。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:07.926065+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":147,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T20:46:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:17.781753+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:08.050407+00:00","content_hash":"04e9b55e282d041b552b1682a54ff03ce83837ddfd852c4e0893b1047e4bf6b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}